1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:01,499
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,041
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,875 --> 00:00:06,125
(Episode 88)

4
00:00:06,208 --> 00:00:08,875
So Lee Cheol is still alive?

5
00:00:09,291 --> 00:00:11,333
That's right. They said it was a woman.

6
00:00:11,375 --> 00:00:14,958
Then whose body was it?
There were only four people there.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,478
I don't know exactly what happened.

8
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:21,077
Uncle looked into it through the General.

9
00:00:21,533 --> 00:00:24,484
They'll probably run DNA tests
and do some more examinations.

10
00:00:25,583 --> 00:00:29,291
They need to find out
how the body is connected to Lee Cheol,

11
00:00:29,666 --> 00:00:32,583
and why it was hidden in that house.

12
00:00:32,625 --> 00:00:37,113
He must've set the fire on purpose...

13
00:00:37,114 --> 00:00:38,502
to cover up the body.

14
00:00:39,602 --> 00:00:40,889
That's possible.

15
00:00:41,375 --> 00:00:43,965
It could be one of those unsolved cases
from years ago.

16
00:00:44,413 --> 00:00:46,541
What if he's a serial killer?

17
00:00:46,594 --> 00:00:49,000
That's scary. Let's stop talking about it.

18
00:00:49,701 --> 00:00:50,761
It gives me chills.

19
00:00:50,875 --> 00:00:54,833
The lawyer will seek his release
once the report comes in.

20
00:00:55,488 --> 00:00:56,488
Okay.

21
00:00:58,502 --> 00:01:00,335
- Really?
- Yes.

22
00:01:01,458 --> 00:01:05,041
My gut tells me it's probably
that bastard's mother.

23
00:01:05,388 --> 00:01:06,971
I told you about this before.

24
00:01:07,127 --> 00:01:09,377
His father was officially reported dead,

25
00:01:09,416 --> 00:01:11,833
but after his mother was reported missing,
there was no trace of her.

26
00:01:12,516 --> 00:01:15,016
Either way, we'll be able to put
that bastard behind bars.

27
00:01:15,791 --> 00:01:19,083
It looks like you won't need
to do anything special.

28
00:01:19,204 --> 00:01:20,479
Seriously, you...

29
00:01:20,572 --> 00:01:22,208
What do you mean, me doing something?

30
00:01:22,291 --> 00:01:23,333
What?

31
00:01:24,125 --> 00:01:25,409
Yes, of course.

32
00:01:26,807 --> 00:01:30,265
Anyway, is Ji Hu still not back?

33
00:01:32,083 --> 00:01:34,291
It's only 8 p.m.

34
00:01:34,333 --> 00:01:36,644
He should catch up with his friends.
It's been a while.

35
00:01:36,645 --> 00:01:38,110
He's been through a lot.

36
00:01:38,956 --> 00:01:41,684
Still, Ji Ni can't even bring herself
to leave her room.

37
00:01:41,979 --> 00:01:43,672
Just leave him be.

38
00:01:46,291 --> 00:01:47,791
He'll be home soon.

39
00:01:48,416 --> 00:01:51,413
You're still pretty cold toward
my daughter-in-law, I see.

40
00:01:52,930 --> 00:01:54,713
I'll try harder.

41
00:02:03,458 --> 00:02:04,800
Hey, isn't this way too spicy?

42
00:02:05,333 --> 00:02:07,041
Life hasn't been spicy enough for you yet.

43
00:02:07,283 --> 00:02:09,324
I thought you could handle
this level of spice.

44
00:02:09,541 --> 00:02:10,834
Seriously.

45
00:02:11,547 --> 00:02:13,500
You said we were having dinner.
This is torture.

46
00:02:14,791 --> 00:02:17,988
I'm leaving. I'm worried about Ji Ni.

47
00:02:18,375 --> 00:02:19,833
Come on.

48
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,864
Ji Ni needs some time to herself too.

49
00:02:21,865 --> 00:02:23,263
Don't bother her. Stay here.

50
00:02:23,375 --> 00:02:25,250
We have blood sausage too.
Have some of each.

51
00:02:27,983 --> 00:02:31,373
- The drinks are here.
- Hey, you're here?

52
00:02:33,833 --> 00:02:36,375
Something about you seems different.

53
00:02:36,732 --> 00:02:37,732
Really?

54
00:02:38,346 --> 00:02:41,100
Ji Hu, do I look any different?

55
00:02:42,138 --> 00:02:43,846
Not that I can tell.

56
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:47,618
Stop picking on her and eat.
Jung A's just Jung A.

57
00:02:48,041 --> 00:02:50,833
Hey, are you only perceptive
when you feel like it?

58
00:02:51,732 --> 00:02:53,316
How can you not notice?

59
00:02:54,708 --> 00:02:56,916
You can't have spicy rice cakes
without drinks.

60
00:02:57,833 --> 00:02:59,851
I drove here.

61
00:02:59,852 --> 00:03:00,972
You two go ahead and drink.

62
00:03:01,250 --> 00:03:02,666
Seriously...

63
00:03:06,208 --> 00:03:07,279
Bottoms up for the first drink?

64
00:03:07,821 --> 00:03:09,530
You're really trying to kill me.

65
00:03:09,531 --> 00:03:11,872
Fine, let's die. Bottoms up.

66
00:03:22,958 --> 00:03:25,291
What a lightweight.

67
00:03:26,833 --> 00:03:28,250
Stop drinking.

68
00:03:28,697 --> 00:03:30,452
We should get going
if I'm taking him home.

69
00:03:30,764 --> 00:03:31,764
Come on, let's go.

70
00:03:31,916 --> 00:03:35,541
Already? There's still so much left.

71
00:03:36,524 --> 00:03:38,321
Wasn't tonight supposed to be
a party to cheer you up?

72
00:03:38,532 --> 00:03:40,254
Cheering me up? Come on...

73
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:42,856
I know everything.

74
00:03:44,413 --> 00:03:46,601
You're having a hard time.
You're hurt too.

75
00:03:46,925 --> 00:03:49,802
And you don't know what to do. Am I wrong?

76
00:03:54,416 --> 00:03:58,041
I can imagine exactly
how Ji Ni must feel right now.

77
00:03:59,208 --> 00:04:01,852
She's keeping it all bottled up,
not saying how hard things are,

78
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,396
and that must make things
even harder for you.

79
00:04:06,403 --> 00:04:07,815
You'd know better than anyone.

80
00:04:07,958 --> 00:04:10,161
Do I really? I'm not so sure.

81
00:04:11,877 --> 00:04:13,960
Does anyone really know Ji Ni?

82
00:04:14,629 --> 00:04:17,629
She's always hiding things.
Her feelings, what's going on...

83
00:04:18,725 --> 00:04:19,975
That's just how she is.

84
00:04:20,666 --> 00:04:24,583
She never talks about herself first.
I'm always the one doing all the talking.

85
00:04:25,074 --> 00:04:26,131
Were you hurt by that too?

86
00:04:26,333 --> 00:04:29,333
We've known each other since college.
Almost ten years.

87
00:04:30,096 --> 00:04:31,883
After everything I've done for her,

88
00:04:31,885 --> 00:04:34,442
I can't believe she hid so much
from me all this time.

89
00:04:35,886 --> 00:04:39,969
I didn't find out
until her father's funeral.

90
00:04:40,823 --> 00:04:42,691
I almost ended our friendship over it.

91
00:04:43,149 --> 00:04:44,255
That's when you found out?

92
00:04:45,208 --> 00:04:46,208
Yeah.

93
00:04:47,379 --> 00:04:49,469
When I first met Ji Ni,

94
00:04:49,470 --> 00:04:53,338
I thought, "So people really are born
into perfect families."

95
00:04:54,375 --> 00:04:56,916
Parents, talent, beauty...

96
00:04:59,089 --> 00:05:02,241
I thought life had given her everything.

97
00:05:04,408 --> 00:05:06,851
What? Why are you laughing?

98
00:05:06,852 --> 00:05:08,106
Is my story funny?

99
00:05:08,716 --> 00:05:10,375
I'm telling you something sad.

100
00:05:10,416 --> 00:05:11,438
I know.

101
00:05:12,081 --> 00:05:13,706
People have misunderstood me
just like they misunderstood Ji Ni.

102
00:05:13,833 --> 00:05:15,354
You're even more perfect, Ji Hu.

103
00:05:16,250 --> 00:05:18,487
Perfection paired with perfection.

104
00:05:19,763 --> 00:05:21,096
Isn't that what your marriage is?

105
00:05:22,263 --> 00:05:24,874
Are you always like this
when you're drunk? You're funny.

106
00:05:26,471 --> 00:05:28,930
Still, doesn't it hurt
that she even hid the pregnancy?

107
00:05:30,066 --> 00:05:31,767
She said she wanted to be sure
before telling me.

108
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:35,041
I really should get going.

109
00:05:35,857 --> 00:05:37,030
Don't go.

110
00:05:37,709 --> 00:05:39,149
Have just one more drink.

111
00:05:41,733 --> 00:05:43,150
Okay, just one more.

112
00:05:44,458 --> 00:05:46,375
Great, I've got you to stay.

113
00:05:49,958 --> 00:05:53,274
Seriously, your smile is so beautiful.

114
00:05:54,416 --> 00:05:56,007
It feels like being shot.

115
00:05:57,109 --> 00:06:00,541
Are you going to keep teasing me?
How can you hold your liquor so well?

116
00:06:00,583 --> 00:06:02,541
You're the lightweight.

117
00:06:02,666 --> 00:06:04,519
You got drunk so quickly last time too.

118
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:07,458
I had to decide whether to take you
to a motel or home.

119
00:06:08,864 --> 00:06:10,312
It was my first time at your place,

120
00:06:10,346 --> 00:06:13,397
and if I'd carried you home at 1 a.m.,
what would that have made me look like?

121
00:06:14,791 --> 00:06:17,047
You drank that night to comfort me too.

122
00:06:19,250 --> 00:06:20,891
I just keep finding reasons
to be grateful to you.

123
00:06:28,763 --> 00:06:31,038
Na Ji Ni, you stupid girl.

124
00:06:32,158 --> 00:06:34,616
Take the hint and get out of here already.

125
00:06:49,375 --> 00:06:50,541
Mom.

126
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:53,781
Hey, you're here?

127
00:06:53,916 --> 00:06:55,101
Good timing.

128
00:06:55,102 --> 00:06:58,666
Give Ji Ni this so she can sleep.

129
00:06:59,544 --> 00:07:02,148
Ji Ni is having the hardest time
right now.

130
00:07:02,149 --> 00:07:03,359
Be good to her.

131
00:07:03,416 --> 00:07:06,791
If she won't talk, don't push her.
Go sleep in your uncle's room.

132
00:07:07,250 --> 00:07:09,375
Women get sensitive at times like this.

133
00:07:12,033 --> 00:07:13,324
I'm a mother too.

134
00:07:13,865 --> 00:07:15,698
When Ji Ni was doing fine,

135
00:07:15,889 --> 00:07:18,625
I nagged her about becoming
my daughter-in-law,

136
00:07:18,833 --> 00:07:20,833
but when she's sick,
I should take care of her.

137
00:07:23,210 --> 00:07:24,460
Thank you, Mom.

138
00:07:25,125 --> 00:07:26,125
Okay.

139
00:08:05,666 --> 00:08:07,875
You're back? You're late.

140
00:08:07,916 --> 00:08:09,086
Yes, a little.

141
00:08:10,541 --> 00:08:12,508
Honey, drink this before you go to sleep.

142
00:08:12,665 --> 00:08:14,019
Uncle made it for you.

143
00:08:17,416 --> 00:08:18,536
Drink it all.

144
00:08:28,377 --> 00:08:29,710
That's my girl.

145
00:08:30,958 --> 00:08:32,105
Go back to sleep now.

146
00:09:10,294 --> 00:09:12,127
Jung A, what's gotten into you?

147
00:09:14,250 --> 00:09:15,979
Do you look down on Ji Ni too?

148
00:09:19,721 --> 00:09:21,477
One drink, and then we go.

149
00:09:24,002 --> 00:09:25,044
No.

150
00:09:32,908 --> 00:09:34,366
I like Ji Hu.

151
00:09:43,096 --> 00:09:44,852
Cha Seung Hyun, you have a visitor.

152
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:53,002
The body was a woman's.

153
00:09:53,326 --> 00:09:55,325
She'd been stabbed a long time ago.

154
00:09:55,758 --> 00:09:57,916
What? Then...

155
00:09:58,024 --> 00:09:59,816
You didn't kill anyone.

156
00:10:00,649 --> 00:10:02,066
You didn't set the fire, either.

157
00:10:04,456 --> 00:10:06,956
Then who was it? No one else was there.

158
00:10:07,001 --> 00:10:08,258
Lee Cheol's mother.

159
00:10:09,402 --> 00:10:12,774
- What?
- We got the final report this morning.

160
00:10:13,081 --> 00:10:16,123
Your lawyer has filed with the court
to have you released.

161
00:10:16,125 --> 00:10:18,166
You could be out as soon as tomorrow.

162
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:23,294
What are you smiling about?

163
00:10:23,541 --> 00:10:25,666
Don't forget what you promised me.

164
00:10:25,783 --> 00:10:27,991
You won't lose your temper again, okay?

165
00:10:28,595 --> 00:10:30,841
Yes. It won't happen again.

166
00:10:31,232 --> 00:10:32,262
I'm sorry.

167
00:10:33,458 --> 00:10:36,250
Then where's Lee Cheol?

168
00:10:36,956 --> 00:10:40,183
We never saw him come out.
Was there another door?

169
00:10:40,389 --> 00:10:43,714
Nearby security cameras
caught him escaping.

170
00:10:43,715 --> 00:10:44,889
They'll investigate now.

171
00:10:46,416 --> 00:10:47,543
So that's what happened.

172
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:50,311
How's Ji Ni doing?

173
00:10:51,649 --> 00:10:54,107
Mom's staying with me to avoid Ji Ni.

174
00:10:54,513 --> 00:10:56,800
Even now, you're worried about Ji Ni?

175
00:10:56,924 --> 00:10:58,346
Think about yourself.

176
00:10:59,416 --> 00:11:01,458
- But still...
- Enough.

177
00:11:01,791 --> 00:11:03,225
Just think about yourself.

178
00:11:11,375 --> 00:11:14,958
Security cameras
caught that bastard escaping.

179
00:11:15,566 --> 00:11:18,399
How could they lock up my son
before properly investigating?

180
00:11:18,456 --> 00:11:20,029
This is ridiculous.

181
00:11:20,159 --> 00:11:23,284
Exactly. Okay, see you later.

182
00:11:27,835 --> 00:11:30,710
Wait. Lee Cheol is alive?

183
00:11:32,250 --> 00:11:34,011
Could Maestro be in danger?

184
00:11:47,625 --> 00:11:50,416
You're taking your herbal medicine, right?

185
00:11:50,698 --> 00:11:51,916
Of course.

186
00:11:52,541 --> 00:11:56,708
When I was young, I'd recover
from this in just a few days.

187
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,125
You're still young.

188
00:11:59,241 --> 00:12:02,283
But that guy, Lee Cheol...

189
00:12:03,125 --> 00:12:05,205
How did he know where Maestro was filming?

190
00:12:05,206 --> 00:12:06,416
You got hurt there too, right?

191
00:12:06,458 --> 00:12:07,916
How would I know?

192
00:12:08,502 --> 00:12:12,169
Maybe he followed her
or tracked her location...

193
00:12:12,916 --> 00:12:14,208
Or...

194
00:12:14,291 --> 00:12:15,333
Or what?

195
00:12:16,250 --> 00:12:18,041
They'd agreed to meet there.

196
00:12:21,493 --> 00:12:22,717
Get plenty of rest.

197
00:12:35,438 --> 00:12:37,105
He tracked her location. That's it.

198
00:12:37,965 --> 00:12:39,166
If that's true...

199
00:12:44,252 --> 00:12:45,460
Hello.

200
00:12:45,887 --> 00:12:47,179
Mrs. Na?

201
00:12:47,710 --> 00:12:49,585
I'm here to see Ji Ni. Is she home?

202
00:13:05,357 --> 00:13:07,191
I can't even give this to him.

203
00:13:12,527 --> 00:13:13,569
What are you doing here?

204
00:13:14,055 --> 00:13:15,390
I've got something to say too.

205
00:13:15,756 --> 00:13:17,476
You can't just have your say and leave.

206
00:13:17,583 --> 00:13:21,583
You know what I'm going through.
How could you do this to me?

207
00:13:21,857 --> 00:13:23,399
Are you on the official wife's side too?

208
00:13:25,500 --> 00:13:27,136
Just because you're the official wife,

209
00:13:27,137 --> 00:13:29,839
does that mean you can look down on
someone like me, the mistress?

210
00:13:30,372 --> 00:13:32,081
We weren't married, but we were in love.

211
00:13:32,083 --> 00:13:33,438
Does that make my love a crime?

212
00:13:33,439 --> 00:13:35,927
Even you think my feelings
as a mom don't matter?

213
00:13:36,493 --> 00:13:37,493
Leave.

214
00:13:37,791 --> 00:13:39,833
I don't even want to talk. Just leave.

215
00:13:39,875 --> 00:13:42,666
You brat. You're only cruel to me.

216
00:13:42,761 --> 00:13:45,469
You sympathize with everyone else,
but you treat me like this.

217
00:13:46,583 --> 00:13:49,340
You've looked down on me
since you donated your bone marrow.

218
00:13:49,375 --> 00:13:51,063
Have I always been this way?

219
00:13:51,064 --> 00:13:53,208
I got sick of begging.
That's what made me like this.

220
00:13:53,916 --> 00:13:55,357
You're the only daughter I have.

221
00:13:55,358 --> 00:13:58,000
How can you be so cruel only to me?

222
00:13:58,041 --> 00:14:00,458
You even forgave that bitch Do Hee,
but not me!

223
00:14:01,333 --> 00:14:02,374
You really don't know why?

224
00:14:02,375 --> 00:14:03,690
No, I don't.

225
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:07,375
I may have wronged everyone else,
but I always did my best for you.

226
00:14:07,629 --> 00:14:11,629
I played my fingers raw,
all to give you the best I could!

227
00:14:12,625 --> 00:14:13,961
They say mistresses...

228
00:14:14,229 --> 00:14:16,950
are more devoted to their in-laws,
husbands, and children.

229
00:14:17,541 --> 00:14:19,593
Maybe they feel
they have to prove themselves.

230
00:14:20,941 --> 00:14:21,941
What?

231
00:14:22,356 --> 00:14:24,231
Of all people, why am I your daughter?

232
00:14:24,708 --> 00:14:26,764
Why do I have a mother like you?

233
00:14:27,416 --> 00:14:29,730
I'm ashamed. I'm embarrassed.

234
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:31,250
You brat...

235
00:14:32,916 --> 00:14:33,916
Hit me.

236
00:14:34,497 --> 00:14:36,084
If that will fix things, I'll take it.

237
00:14:40,221 --> 00:14:43,026
No matter how much you regret it
or how often you apologize,

238
00:14:44,026 --> 00:14:45,461
nothing can change.

239
00:14:45,916 --> 00:14:47,208
That's why I feel hopeless.

240
00:14:49,544 --> 00:14:52,502
That's why I don't want to live anymore.
I just want to disappear.

241
00:14:53,250 --> 00:14:55,971
I wish I'd gone with Dad when he died.

242
00:14:57,721 --> 00:15:02,263
I regret getting married,
thinking someone like me could be happy.

243
00:15:05,041 --> 00:15:07,793
You are...

244
00:15:09,327 --> 00:15:11,291
incredibly cruel.

245
00:17:19,541 --> 00:17:20,541
Yes, Sa Bin?

246
00:17:20,583 --> 00:17:22,418
Maestro, where are you?

247
00:17:23,041 --> 00:17:25,353
Has Lee Cheol come looking for you?

248
00:17:26,125 --> 00:17:29,541
What? Lee Cheol? He's dead.

249
00:17:29,583 --> 00:17:31,458
Why would you say that? You're scaring me.

250
00:17:31,500 --> 00:17:33,500
No, he's not dead.

251
00:17:33,541 --> 00:17:35,416
The body in the house was his mother's.

252
00:17:35,574 --> 00:17:37,824
He may have killed his own mother too.
Be careful.

253
00:17:37,833 --> 00:17:39,166
What?

254
00:17:39,208 --> 00:17:41,958
First, replace your phone.
Actually, get rid of it.

255
00:17:42,166 --> 00:17:43,283
Why my phone?

256
00:17:43,416 --> 00:17:45,708
I heard he showed up at your shoot.

257
00:17:45,941 --> 00:17:47,335
Lieutenant No got hurt there too.

258
00:17:47,666 --> 00:17:50,958
I think he installed something
on your phone.

259
00:17:51,706 --> 00:17:55,206
Then he knows where I am right now?

260
00:17:55,208 --> 00:17:57,541
You should be safe
if he hasn't come for you yet.

261
00:17:57,916 --> 00:18:01,791
The police are looking for him,
so he probably won't risk showing up.

262
00:18:02,000 --> 00:18:05,666
Still, turn off your phone
and replace it as soon as possible.

263
00:18:08,658 --> 00:18:10,783
Maestro? Hello?

264
00:18:11,125 --> 00:18:13,399
No, forget it.

265
00:18:13,556 --> 00:18:15,632
Let him come. Who cares if I die?

266
00:18:16,375 --> 00:18:17,375
What?

267
00:18:17,377 --> 00:18:20,585
That bastard took all that money
and didn't keep his promise.

268
00:18:20,870 --> 00:18:21,993
Let him come.

269
00:18:22,166 --> 00:18:23,875
I'll kill him myself.

270
00:18:31,458 --> 00:18:33,926
Fine. This works out perfectly.

271
00:18:35,460 --> 00:18:36,682
Let's go down together.

272
00:18:36,877 --> 00:18:39,127
Just wait till I get my hands on you.

273
00:18:43,500 --> 00:18:45,815
She can't do this. Seriously...

274
00:18:46,875 --> 00:18:49,349
Wait a minute.

275
00:18:49,572 --> 00:18:53,416
No, I can't go. I shouldn't go.

276
00:19:00,074 --> 00:19:01,074
Hello?

277
00:19:02,661 --> 00:19:04,465
What? My mother-in-law?

278
00:19:04,708 --> 00:19:07,639
Yes. Hurry over, replace her phone,
and check on her.

279
00:19:07,958 --> 00:19:09,708
Maestro's acting strange.

280
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:13,606
If Lee Cheol shows up,
she's ready to take him on.

281
00:19:13,669 --> 00:19:15,373
Ji Ni told me not to go, no matter what.

282
00:19:15,375 --> 00:19:17,164
But you're still better
at handling her than I am.

283
00:19:17,166 --> 00:19:19,264
I'll explain everything later. You go.

284
00:19:19,265 --> 00:19:22,333
You're the only one who can.
I'm telling you, it's dangerous.

285
00:19:23,515 --> 00:19:24,515
Okay.

286
00:19:41,041 --> 00:19:43,554
I'm sorry. I want to be alone.

287
00:19:44,583 --> 00:19:46,074
Do you even know who's here?

288
00:19:46,330 --> 00:19:47,440
It's me, Cha Seung Woo.

289
00:19:47,791 --> 00:19:49,695
Do you always lock yourself in your room?

290
00:19:50,097 --> 00:19:51,375
Still going through puberty?

291
00:19:52,083 --> 00:19:53,916
Give me the painting.
I'm here to pick it up.

292
00:19:58,416 --> 00:19:59,505
Are you a mole?

293
00:19:59,799 --> 00:20:02,042
You need some sunlight and human company.

294
00:20:10,452 --> 00:20:11,750
It's finished.

295
00:20:13,111 --> 00:20:16,195
It's my last project with Ms. Song,
so I want to get it right.

296
00:20:16,416 --> 00:20:18,041
Is that so?

297
00:20:21,106 --> 00:20:22,581
Then why do you keep hiding in here?

298
00:20:24,041 --> 00:20:26,104
I don't want to see anyone.

299
00:20:26,375 --> 00:20:27,833
I'm so ashamed and sorry.

300
00:20:27,875 --> 00:20:29,459
What did you do wrong?

301
00:20:29,901 --> 00:20:31,443
Just be yourself and live your life.

302
00:20:32,502 --> 00:20:34,085
Don't take the blame
for what your mom did.

303
00:20:36,346 --> 00:20:37,527
It's not that easy.

304
00:20:38,041 --> 00:20:39,250
I felt the same way.

305
00:20:39,875 --> 00:20:40,973
I hated...

306
00:20:42,897 --> 00:20:44,666
that Dad was my own flesh and blood.

307
00:20:45,158 --> 00:20:46,829
But Seung Hyun always told me,

308
00:20:47,458 --> 00:20:48,917
we don't have to be like our dad.

309
00:20:48,974 --> 00:20:51,418
We just have to live our own lives.

310
00:20:51,783 --> 00:20:54,182
Once we're born, we're our own people.

311
00:20:56,333 --> 00:20:59,000
You're not destined to be
like your mom, either.

312
00:21:01,375 --> 00:21:04,000
Thank you for coming to see me.

313
00:21:05,208 --> 00:21:07,056
Yeong Ju's left.

314
00:21:08,033 --> 00:21:09,574
Mom has mixed feelings.

315
00:21:10,407 --> 00:21:12,088
She hates your mom,

316
00:21:13,445 --> 00:21:16,888
but you got hurt trying
to protect Seung Hyun.

317
00:21:18,594 --> 00:21:20,011
I just feel sorry.

318
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:21,250
There you go again!

319
00:21:21,478 --> 00:21:22,958
I told you not to think that way.

320
00:21:31,855 --> 00:21:32,855
Mother.

321
00:21:33,649 --> 00:21:35,636
I don't have a daughter anymore.
I'm on my own now.

322
00:21:35,649 --> 00:21:37,914
I'm sick of the Cha and Na families.

323
00:21:38,377 --> 00:21:40,145
There's nothing left to hide.

324
00:21:40,146 --> 00:21:42,794
Now that everything's out
and I've been condemned, I feel lighter.

325
00:21:42,833 --> 00:21:43,875
Don't come here anymore.

326
00:21:43,945 --> 00:21:46,413
Uncle called and said
you needed a new phone,

327
00:21:46,448 --> 00:21:47,448
so I bought you one.

328
00:21:51,205 --> 00:21:52,914
No one followed you here, did they?

329
00:21:52,938 --> 00:21:54,813
I'm too scared to even go outside.

330
00:21:55,208 --> 00:21:57,333
Take good care of Ji Ni.

331
00:21:57,739 --> 00:21:58,947
I thought you said you had no daughter.

332
00:21:59,416 --> 00:22:04,833
I'm saying, take care of your wife,
not my daughter.

333
00:22:06,583 --> 00:22:07,583
Okay.

334
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:14,216
I got your mom a new phone.

335
00:22:16,416 --> 00:22:17,470
You went there again?

336
00:22:18,291 --> 00:22:19,615
I told you not to.

337
00:22:19,616 --> 00:22:21,499
Why do you keep going
when I say she's not my mom?

338
00:22:21,500 --> 00:22:22,791
Lee Cheol's alive.

339
00:22:23,291 --> 00:22:25,208
They think her phone is being tracked.

340
00:22:25,250 --> 00:22:27,458
Uncle asked me to get her a new one.

341
00:22:27,658 --> 00:22:31,116
- What?
- Even if you can turn away, I can't.

342
00:22:31,504 --> 00:22:33,171
Don't stop me from doing my duty
as her son-in-law.

343
00:22:33,291 --> 00:22:35,958
- You have a serious hero complex.
- What?

344
00:22:36,106 --> 00:22:38,845
If I don't have a mom,
how can you have a mother-in-law?

345
00:22:38,847 --> 00:22:39,911
Does that make any sense?

346
00:22:41,577 --> 00:22:43,327
Honestly, I don't understand how you feel.

347
00:22:43,794 --> 00:22:45,460
I've never fought with my birth mother.

348
00:22:45,627 --> 00:22:47,919
- Ji Hu.
- Then stay here by yourself.

349
00:22:48,401 --> 00:22:50,263
I won't bother you
until you've had time to cool off.

350
00:23:09,583 --> 00:23:10,583
Ji Hu.

351
00:23:11,252 --> 00:23:12,252
Mom.

352
00:23:12,687 --> 00:23:15,210
Let's have a hotel staycation tonight.

353
00:23:15,791 --> 00:23:19,422
We'll have a nice dinner
and enjoy the night view.

354
00:23:19,541 --> 00:23:20,833
I'm not in the mood.

355
00:23:22,208 --> 00:23:24,333
Ji Ni said she wants to be alone.

356
00:23:25,138 --> 00:23:26,888
Your dad won't be home tonight either.

357
00:23:27,041 --> 00:23:29,364
Ji Ni doesn't have family to go to.

358
00:23:29,365 --> 00:23:31,163
She probably has nowhere else to stay.

359
00:23:31,972 --> 00:23:33,291
Let's give her some space.

360
00:23:34,077 --> 00:23:35,995
Even if you stay
on the living room couch...

361
00:23:36,496 --> 00:23:39,306
or in your uncle's room,
she'll still feel uncomfortable.

362
00:23:39,763 --> 00:23:42,328
Don't you think? She's softhearted.

363
00:23:43,035 --> 00:23:45,550
I think it'd be better
if we just left for the night.

364
00:23:59,125 --> 00:24:02,205
Here, have a drink.

365
00:24:02,375 --> 00:24:03,416
Okay.

366
00:24:09,625 --> 00:24:13,060
I invited someone over. Hold on.

367
00:24:13,833 --> 00:24:15,500
- Someone's coming?
- Yeah.

368
00:24:22,857 --> 00:24:24,482
- You're here.
- Hello, ma'am.

369
00:24:29,916 --> 00:24:32,391
Glad you made it. Was traffic bad?

370
00:24:32,836 --> 00:24:34,047
Ji Hu!

371
00:24:34,404 --> 00:24:36,041
Ma'am, weren't you here alone?

372
00:24:37,210 --> 00:24:39,502
Jung A is Ji Ni's closest friend.

373
00:24:40,199 --> 00:24:42,125
I thought we three could talk.

374
00:24:42,791 --> 00:24:46,125
Maybe we can figure out
how to cheer Ji Ni up.

375
00:24:46,585 --> 00:24:49,960
Amazing! I've never met
a mother-in-law like you.

376
00:24:50,138 --> 00:24:52,590
I'll do everything I can to help Ji Ni.

377
00:24:53,764 --> 00:24:54,878
Thank you.

378
00:24:55,024 --> 00:24:57,322
I didn't know you were so worried, Mom.

379
00:24:57,680 --> 00:24:59,852
Just live long enough
to understand how I feel, son.

380
00:25:01,125 --> 00:25:02,586
I feel so ashamed.

381
00:25:02,743 --> 00:25:04,309
I've been so caught up
in my own struggles.

382
00:25:04,375 --> 00:25:07,333
Of course I'm most worried about you.

383
00:25:09,255 --> 00:25:12,839
This hotel is huge. It's like a castle!

384
00:25:16,458 --> 00:25:19,291
- Go show her around.
- Okay.

385
00:25:53,583 --> 00:25:58,125
This couch is so nice. It's really comfy.

386
00:25:59,578 --> 00:26:01,593
Here, have a drink.

387
00:26:03,117 --> 00:26:04,225
Hold on.

388
00:26:04,682 --> 00:26:06,250
You know that lady from Buam Dong?

389
00:26:06,625 --> 00:26:08,469
She's here with her family.

390
00:26:08,666 --> 00:26:11,125
I'll go say hello real quick.

391
00:26:11,166 --> 00:26:12,208
Okay.

392
00:26:39,652 --> 00:26:42,532
Ji Ni may be putting up a wall right now,
but it won't last.

393
00:26:43,583 --> 00:26:46,916
She's softhearted.
She'll come around soon.

394
00:26:47,666 --> 00:26:49,000
In my experience.

395
00:27:05,198 --> 00:27:07,059
You've been so tired lately, haven't you?

396
00:27:08,625 --> 00:27:10,125
Get some sleep if you're tired.

397
00:27:12,335 --> 00:27:13,585
Did you get a room?

398
00:27:15,107 --> 00:27:16,982
I should head home now.

399
00:27:17,397 --> 00:27:19,563
I'll say goodbye to your mom
before I leave.

400
00:27:19,708 --> 00:27:24,875
No, I'll get you a cab.

401
00:27:26,625 --> 00:27:27,875
Are you okay?

402
00:27:29,333 --> 00:27:31,166
Go on. Get some sleep.

403
00:27:31,375 --> 00:27:33,041
No, I'm fine.

404
00:27:33,791 --> 00:27:36,291
I'm sorry. Get home safely.

405
00:28:16,460 --> 00:28:18,625
I'm sorry, Ji Ni.

406
00:28:44,166 --> 00:28:47,499
(Family Register)

407
00:28:47,500 --> 00:28:49,916
I really want to become
your daughter-in-law. Please guide me.

408
00:28:49,958 --> 00:28:51,625
You'll need to be fully prepared too.

409
00:28:51,666 --> 00:28:53,458
- What about Ji Ni?
- I can't keep waiting forever.

410
00:28:53,500 --> 00:28:55,333
You think it's easy for me
to just sit back and wait?

411
00:28:55,375 --> 00:28:57,750
What's this? Does Ji Hu like Jung A too?

412
00:28:57,833 --> 00:28:59,500
Consider it payback. Just leave.

413
00:28:59,541 --> 00:29:01,708
Stay away from Ji Hu and me.

414
00:29:01,750 --> 00:29:03,625
Do you think I'm a joke?
Are you looking down on me too?

415
00:29:03,666 --> 00:29:05,083
I was so happy.

416
00:29:05,125 --> 00:29:08,166
You should be the one paying
for what your mom did.

417
00:29:08,666 --> 00:29:10,666
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)

